<title>INDIA: SOCCER-INDIA AND UZBEKISTAN DRAW 2-2 IN NEHRU GOLD CUP.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-INDIA AND UZBEKISTAN DRAW 2-2 IN NEHRU GOLD CUP.</headline>
<dateline>COCHIN, India 1997-04-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Result in the preliminary</p>
<p>league match of the five-nation Nehru Gold Cup international</p>
<p>soccer tournament on Friday:</p>
<p>India drew with Uzbekistan 2-2 (halftime 1-1)</p>
<p>Scorers:</p>
<p>Uzbekistan - Anvarjon Soliev 25, Andrei Akopyanis 72</p>
<p>India - I.M.Vijayan 42, Carlton Chapman 85</p>
</text>
